 * fills them, so no Rust consumer can build an origin carrying a path, and
 * [`Deserialize`] re-runs the same check on the way in. The UniFFI record
 * lifts field by field without touching serde, so a Swift or Kotlin host can
 * hand one back unchecked; the phone binding re-parses on the way in -- see
 * `paygent_mobile_core::approvals`.
